<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠπεροπ-εύω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 Verb, used only in pres. and impf.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cheat, cajole</i>: c. acc.
			pers., esp. of <i>seduction</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκας ἀνάλκιδας ἠπεροπεύεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.349
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τά τε φρένας ἠπεροπεύει θηλυτέρῃσι
					γυναιξί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.421
				</span></i>
			; so of Aphrodite, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί με ταύ͂τα
				λιχαίεαι ἠπεροπεύειν</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.399
			</span></i>: generally, <i><span class="en">
				23.605
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.400
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.419
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμὰς φρένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.327
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				55
			</span></i>.</div>
